The label files in this directory (*.npz) are annotations of the RDDAC
dataset (doi:10.18419/DARUS-5589) and are licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), like the dataset they
annotate. When using them, attribute the RDDAC dataset.

